# Yarn Bundle (items.md Ammo, 4 yarn shells): three red yarn balls stacked in a pyramid, wound
# strands as diagonal light/dark runs (no dithering), lit from the top-left, dark crevices between
# the balls. Composed from one ball shape, then pixel-corrected by hand.
name yarn_idle_d0_f0
size 16 12
= O red_02
= A red_04
= B red_07
= C red_10
= D red_13
grid
......DDC.......
.....DCDDC......
....DCDDCCB.....
....CDDCCBC.....
..DDCDCCBCDDC...
.DCDDCBBADCDDC..
DCDDCCBAODCDDCB.
CDDCCBCAOCDDCBC.
DDCCBCBAODDCCBC.
.CCBCBAO.CCBCBA.
..BBAAO...BBAA..
................
